+/*
+ * 0...2...........8...............16
+ *  +-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+
+ * | X X X X X X X X X X X | C C C P P |
+ *  +-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+
+ *  X = Unused options bits
+ *  C = Compression bits
+ *  P = Padding bits
+ *  C = 0b111 would be extended compression options which would come in as an
+ *      additional header before the payload.
+ *  C = 0b000 to indicate no compression
+*/
